        "section_title": "The World of <brown>Shilajit</brown>!",
        "section_description": "<span>Inspired by Ayurveda and Modern Science</span>\n High in the Himalayas, shilajit slowly emerges from mountain rock after forming through natural processes over centuries. Himalayan communities have recognized and gathered it for generations, and ancient Ayurvedic texts, including the Charaka Samhita, describe its traditional use. Today, Everest Shilajit carefully sources authentic Himalayan shilajit from three districts in Nepal—Solukhumbu, Dolpa, and Darchula. Every batch is independently lab tested before it reaches you.",
