      "settings": {
        "section_title": "One Source. <brown>Four Ways</brown>",
        "section_description": "Every Everest Shilajit product begins with the same pure Himalayan shilajit. The difference isn't what goes into it—it's how it fits into your daily routine. Whether you prefer the traditional experience of resin, the convenience of tablets, the simplicity of liquid, or the ease of gummies, every format starts with the same commitment to quality. \n<a href=\"/blogs/shilajit/best-form-of-shilajit-to-take\" class=\"button max-w-max m-auto\" style=\"padding: 1.6rem 5.2rem; margin-top:2.4rem; background:#68453D; color:#fff;\" title=\"Best Form of Shilajit to Take\">Find Your Best Match</a>",
